# Docker build context for the app image (Dockerfile) and the e2e runner
# image (Dockerfile.e2e, which copies nothing from it). Allowlist: everything
# is left out — .git, target/, data/ (local H2 database and uploads), .env and
# any other secrets, .claude/, IDE folders, logs, docs and design files —
# except exactly what the Dockerfile's COPY steps use: .mvn/, mvnw, pom.xml
# and src/. A file added later stays out of the context (and the image) until
# it is listed here.
*
!.mvn/
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!src/

# Even inside what is kept: never build-local or editor leftovers.
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
